===== 12. Graceful termination: SIGTERM trap and the grace period =====

$ kubectl apply -f manifests/pod-lifecycle/12-termination.yaml
pod/lifecycle-termination created

$ kubectl -n lifecycle wait --for=condition=Ready pod/lifecycle-termination --timeout=120s
pod/lifecycle-termination condition met

$ kubectl -n lifecycle logs lifecycle-termination
# timing the delete: the trap sleeps 10s before exiting

$ kubectl -n lifecycle delete pod lifecycle-termination
pod "lifecycle-termination" deleted from lifecycle namespace
# delete took 13 seconds

===== Summary of every state produced =====

$ kubectl -n lifecycle get pods -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name,PHASE:.status.phase,READY:.status.containerStatuses[0].ready,RESTARTS:.status.containerStatuses[0].restartCount,REASON:.status.containerStatuses[0].state.waiting.reason
NAME                        PHASE       READY    RESTARTS   REASON
